            "review_title": "Review at Yen Sao Khanh Hoa",
            "review_text": "Tony\nLiverpool, United Kingdom22 contributions\n0\nUnpleasant staff !\nJul 2017 • Couples\nDrove past on our motorbike and stopped as it looked really appealing with the sea view. When we entered, the staff gave us an okay seat towards the view. The staff did not show any enthusiasm or effort upon arrival. They seemed unfriendly from when we initially entered. After being handed the menu and ordering drinks, it was okay. However, when we were about to order food and explained what we wanted the staff refused to make us beef noodles and chicken fried rice (something so simple considering how much was on the menu). The waitress seemed persistent and became inpatient which made us feel uncomfortable to stay there. Therefore we did not order food; instead, we finished our drinks and got our check and left. \n\nThe restaurant has so much potential but most of the negativity lies within the staff- friendliness and enthusiasm goes a long way with my professional experience. Probably explains why the restaurant was empty.\nRead more\nWritten July 24, 2017",
