            "review_text": "Martin N\nUsti nad Labem, Czech Republic207 contributions\n0\nNice view but bad services\nNov 2016 • Business\nThis restaurant has a nice view, its clean but the services are really bad. We were waiting 15 minutes for beer and my colleague ordered the meal - beef noodles. They brought him seafood noodles. He said its not the meal i ordered and they said: \"maybe you can try this\". He said no. Were waiting more 20 minutes for the right meal. We did not like this restaurant. There are more than 100 meals in the menu. Do you think everything is fresh? :)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 11, 2016",
