            "review_text": "GaryWW_11\nNha Trang, Vietnam97 contributions\n0\nGreat Little Steak with a fantastic view\nDec 2011\nTHis appears to be a tourist trap kind of a seafood restaurant and is located on the sea with a fantastic view of Nha Trang. I did not try the fish but have returned three times for the steak and fries. Good meat, cooked well and a bargain at less than $5. Very nice restaurant, good staff with no english but the menu is in english, a romantic place at night with the sea and the lights of the city.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 1, 2012",
